before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
public class Main {
    static int sumDown(int n) {
        if (n <= 0) { return 0; }
        return n + sumDown(n - 1);
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(sumDown(3));
    }
}

```

